# ======================================================================
# Node-Pocket: AI Agent & GitHub MCP Credentials Template
# Standard: Zero-Leak Security Protocol
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.agent/.env'
# 2. Generate a Fine-Grained PAT from GitHub (instructions below)
# 3. Paste your token into GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN
# 4. NEVER commit '.agent/.env' to Git (guarded by .gitignore)
# ======================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🔑 GitHub Personal Access Token (Fine-Grained PAT)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for: GitHub MCP Server (github-mcp-server.exe)
# Used by: AI Agent for creating repositories, syncing code, managing issues & PRs
#
# How to generate:
# 1. Open: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# 2. Token name: 'Node-Pocket-Agent' (or any name you prefer)
# 3. Expiration: 90 days (or Custom)
# 4. Repository access: Select 'All repositories'
# 5. Permissions:
#    - Repository permissions:
#        * Administration: Read and write (to create/delete repos)
#        * Contents: Read and write (to read/write files and commit)
#        * Issues: Read and write
#        * Pull requests: Read and write
#        * Workflows: Read and write
#    - Account permissions:
#        * Email addresses: Read-only
# 6. Click 'Generate token' and paste below:

GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN="github_pat_your_token_here"
